<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 79 0 R/Alt(Panarchy Chart for one participant. At the top, a field for the challenge in one sentence. On the left, a ruled field for the influences: people, rules, tools, money, habits. On the right, five horizontal bands from level 1, small and fast, at the bottom to level 5, large and slow, at the top. Each band has a field for its level name. An arrow on the left points up: ideas and experiments spread up. An arrow on the right points down: resources and rules flow down.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block/BBox[45.354332 92.84985 736.4409 535.14526]>>]/K[1]/Pg 103 0 R>>
